# Quests around the village and the wilds. Outcomes, not steps: each ends the
# first time a predicate holds, however the world got there.
# See sim/quests/quest_rules.gd.

=== quest granary
title: Fire in the granary
known: granary_warned or burning.Granary > 0
active: Ruffians squat by the farmer's barn on the west road and threaten to burn it, lamp oil and all.
outcome burned: intact.Granary <= 1
    The barn burned, and the winter's grain with it.
outcome saved: alive.Ruffians == 0 and burning.Granary == 0 and intact.Granary >= 2
    The ruffians are gone and the barn still stands. The farmer will sleep tonight.
    xp: 120

=== quest hammer
title: The smith's hammer
known: hammer_known or has.Forge_hammer > 0
active: A thief stole the smith's forge hammer and ran west towards the bandit camp.
outcome returned: hammer_returned
    The smith has his hammer back, and his forge rings again.
    xp: 100
outcome turned: hostile.Village
    The village turned on us. The smith won't be asking for help now.

=== quest smuggler
title: Wine by the back door
known: smuggler_known
active: A smuggler on the north-west shore keeps the tavern in wine while the road is shut. He wants a package carried to the village.
outcome delivered: package_delivered
    Marta took the package and paid for our silence.
    xp: 80
outcome reported: smuggler_reported
    We told the guard about the smuggler on the old shore.
    xp: 80
outcome robbed: dead.Smugglers > 0
    The smuggler won't be landing any more cargo.

=== quest shepherd
title: The missing shepherd
known: shepherd_known
active: Old Hob the shepherd never came back from the southern hills. Ruffians roam up there.
outcome lost: dead.Shepherd > 0
    We found Old Hob too late.
outcome rescued: alive.HillRuffians == 0 and alive.Shepherd > 0
    The ruffians in the southern hills are gone and Old Hob is safe.
    xp: 150
